MODULE: BindingHeldCrashRepublishesLogical
TARGET: BindingHeld
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a reactivated maintainer publishes no read hold for its persisted physical binding
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ held' = [held EXCEPT ![bound] = checkpoint]
--- REPLACE
    /\ held' = [held EXCEPT ![bound] = -1]
--- END
